Tutorial -> KnowledgeQuiz: check understanding
KnowledgeQuiz -> HandsOnLab: apply concepts
HandsOnLab -> PracticeQuiz: reinforce skills
PracticeQuiz -> Project: portfolio build
Project -> FinalAssessment: prove mastery
FinalAssessment -> Capstone: end to end
